#!/usr/bin/python3
"""eUICC jobs. lpac owns SGP.22; existing modem queues own every AT exchange.

No tty access, NR0 reader, radio resets, profile auto-selection or idle daemon.
The stdio transports also let TLS verification stay enabled with lpac 2.3.0.
"""
